<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9791" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιβαίνω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βήσομαι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go against, withstand,
			resist,</i> c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				236
			</span></i>, Decr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.186
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλευραῖσιν ἀντιβᾶσα</span>”
				<i>having set her foot against . .,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					1126
				</span></i>
			: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιβὰς ἐλᾶν</span> row
				<i>with foot planted against</i> the stretcher, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				202
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				1016
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιασθεὶς πολλὰ κἀντιβάς</span>”
				<i>reluctant,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					575
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ . . μὴ περὶ σοῦ μάχομαι μόνος
					ἀντιβεβηκώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					767
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφι-</span> Dawes); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πρὸς τἀριστερὰ μόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					634a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
